<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n66131" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">μελιχρός</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ά</span>,
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">όν</span>, <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>honey-sweetened</i>, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">οἶνος</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Alc.
					34
				</span></i>
			 (proparox.) <i><span class="en">
				Hp.
				<u>Morb.</u>
				2.12
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Telecl.
				24
			</span></i> (lyr.). </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b>
			<i>honey-sweet</i>, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὀρομαλίδες</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Theoc.
					5.95
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">σῦκα</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					<u>AP</u>
					6.191
				</span></i>
			 (<i><span class="en">
				Corn.
			</span></i> Long.). </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>3.</b>
			metaph., 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὑποσχεσίαι</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					A.R.
					4.359
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">μελιχρότατος περὶ τὰς ἐννοίας</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Philostr.
					<u>VS</u>
					1.22.1
				</span></i>
			; epith. of Sophocles, <i><span class="en">
				<u>AP</u>
				7.22
			</span></i> (<i><span class="en">
				Simm.
			</span></i>); 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τὸ μελιχρότατον τῶν ἐπέων</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Call.
					<u>Epigr.</u>
					29
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τὸ μ. ἐν ταῖς ἀκοαῖς</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					D.H.
					<u>Comp.</u>
					1
				</span></i>
			, cf. <i><span class="en">
				<u>Dem.</u>
				48
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">λωτοὶ κλάζοντες ἴσον φόρμιγγι μελιχρόν</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					<u>APl.</u>
					1.8
				</span></i>
			 (<i><span class="en">
				Alc.
			</span></i>): 
				Comp.
			
			Adv.
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">μελιχρότερον</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Hedyl.
				</span></i>
			 ap. <i><span class="en">
				Ath.
				11.473a
			</span></i>. (Formed from <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">μέλι</span>, as
				<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">πενιχρός</span> from <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">πενία</span>.)</div>
